  "prefLabel": "Occ 401.01 Direct supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 401.01 \"Direct supervision\" means supervision through direct and continuous observation of the activities of the person being supervised and includes in-person and virtual supervision.\n\nSource. #8896, eff 6-7-07; ss by #10902, eff 7-29-15; ss by #14478, eff 3-13-26, EXPIRES: 3-13-36 (formerly Occ 401.03)",
